Article 77-3 (Review of regulation) (1) With respect to Article 30(4) which requires the marking of self-certification on a motor vehicle, the Government shall review feasibility of the abolishment, mitigation or maintenance, etc. of the self-certification requirement every four years as of December 31, 2008.
