This Act shall enter into force one year after the date of its promulgation; provided, the amended provisions of Article 69 shall enter into force on the date of the promulgation; and the provisions concerning a comprehensive inspection of a motor vehicle from among the amended provisions of Article 43-2(1), the amended provisions of the proviso of Article 74(1) and Article 78-2, and the amended provisions of Article 37(1)3, 45-3, 46(1) and (2), 55(5), and 72(1) and (2), paragraph 1 of Article 75, Article 76, 77(2) and (3), 77-2, 80, 81, and 84(1) and (2), and Article 6(2) and (3) of the Addenda shall enter into force on March 29, 2009.
