Article 6 (Transitional measures concerning self-certification of motor vehicle parts)
The Article 34-3 shall be deemed to have been certified as a tuned part that has been tuned pursuant to the previous provisions as at the time the amended provisions of Article 34-3 enter into force.
Article 7 (Transitional measures concerning designation of agencies certifying tuning parts)
Agencies certifying tuning parts under the previous provisions shall be deemed to have been designated as agencies certifying tuning parts pursuant to the same amended provisions as at the time the amended provisions of Article 34-3 enter into force.

